3,"title":"","content":"Part of Hedgespinning HAS been revealed in the dreamwalking section of the playtest files.<br /> <br /> We know how to create Hedgespun Items and dreamweaving items.<br /> <br /> You use dreamweaving to make a dream creature or item into a cobble thought bauble.<br /> <br /> You then merge the cobblethought bauble with a real object, like a love letter or whatever seems appriotate, and a intangable element like a memory, true love, or the screams of a first born baby all togther.<br /> <br /> So three igrediations, Cobble Thought Bauble, Physical Object to make it real, and something intangable to bind the cobble thought bauble to the Physical Object.<br /> <br /> We don't have the merit, so we know how to make them, but not what they can do.<br /> <br /> And we have Dream Vessels, which are object that have had Dreamweaving used on them to place a dream into them.<br /> <br /> I have in the past had the idea that you could turn a wooden stake or arrow into a dream vessel and impaled a vampire in the heart, putting them into tupor, what dream vessel gives them the dream you want them to have. Maybe its a false memory that a rivil court tried to kill the vampire, a nightmare to punish the vampire, or a repeating dream to make the vampired obsessed with something.<br /> <br /> You could do that with some kind of dart and a sleeping drug that allows the victim to dream, turn the dart into a dream vessel.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-08T14:28:07-08:00","id":844149,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/844101-enchanted-item-in-2e?p=844123#post844123\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have in the past had the idea that you could turn a wooden stake or arrow into a dream vessel and impaled a vampire in the heart, putting them into tupor, what dream vessel gives them the dream you want them to have. Maybe its a false memory that a rivil court tried to kill the vampire, a nightmare to punish the vampire, or a repeating dream to make the vampired obsessed with something.<br /> <br /> You could do that with some kind of dart and a sleeping drug that allows the victim to dream, turn the dart into a dream vessel.</div> </div> </div> </div> That's a really cool idea. Perhaps you can use a meal made of goblin fruit, oddments and hobgoblin meat as a dream vessel, if a projectile is too violent for the situation. Knowing how goblin markets work, there might be one with a stall that sells precisely that kind of meal.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}